# Emulation stack from configured repositories. Firmware, BIOS and games are
# never packaged: users import their own dumps with `bep add firmware|rom`.
# Bun Engine: one CLI (`bun-engine`, `bep`), one window, the in-tree cores (DS, ARM, x86).
bun-engine
# Multi-system frontends and cores
retroarch
retroarch-assets-xmb
retroarch-assets-ozone
libretro-core-info
libretro
mame
ares-emu
mednafen
